   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. On-shell HW cyclic states, untwisted homogeneous chain\n\nIn each dominant weight sector: exact null space of {J₁₂, J₂₃, J₃₄, shift − 1}, then diagonalise the generic combination `mixT` of t₁ and t₃ (θ = 0, G = 1) on it. Columns: τ₁(0.123), τ₃(0.41) and the minimal spectral gap with t₁ alone vs with t₁ and t₃ together.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "th0 = ConstantArray[0, LL]; G1 = IdentityMatrix[nn];\nhwStates = Flatten[Table[Module[{idx = sectors[w], A, ns, H, M, M1, ev, ev1, V},\n     A = Join @@ Append[Table[Jop[i, i + 1][[All, idx]], {i, nn - 1}], (shiftM - IdentityMatrix[nn^LL, SparseArray])[[All, idx]]];\n     A = A[[Union[A[\"NonzeroPositions\"][[All, 1]]]]];\n     ns = If[Length[A] == 0, IdentityMatrix[Length[idx]], NullSpace[A]];\n     If[ns === {}, {},\n      H = Normal[SparseArray[Thread[idx -> #], nn^LL]] & /@ Orthogonalize[N[ns]];\n      M = Conjugate[H] . Transpose[mixT[th0, G1, #] & /@ H];\n      M1 = Conjugate[H] . Transpose[t1V[th0, G1, 0.3711, #] + 0.37 t1V[th0, G1, -0.917, #] & /@ H];\n      {ev, V} = Eigensystem[M]; ev1 = Eigenvalues[M1];\n      Table[With[{psi = fixPhase[V[[k]] . H]},\n        <|\"w\" -> w, \"psi\" -> psi,\n         \"tau1\" -> Chop[Conjugate[psi] . t1V[th0, G1, 0.123, psi]], \"tau3\" -> Chop[Conjugate[psi] . t3V[th0, G1, 0.41, psi]],\n         \"gap1\" -> If[Length[ev1] > 1, Min[Abs[ev1[[k]] - Delete[ev1, k]]], Infinity],\n         \"gap13\" -> If[Length[ev] > 1, Min[Abs[ev[[k]] - Delete[ev, k]]], Infinity],\n         \"C\" -> Chop[Table[braVec[l] . psi, {l, 0, LL}], 10^-10]|>], {k, Length[ev]}]]], {w, dominant}], 1];\nGrid[Prepend[{dyn[#w], #tau1, #tau3, ScientificForm[#gap13, 2], Sequence @@ (NumberForm[#, 6] & /@ #C)} & /@ hwStates,\n  Join[{\"Dynkin\", \"τ₁(0.123)\", \"τ₃(0.41)\", \"gap (t₁,t₃)\"}, Table[\"C\" <> ToString[l], {l, 0, LL}]]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"10\" data-out-n=\"155\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"16\" data-sub-end=\"17\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[155]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.44em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Dynkin</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin