  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. Odd-bridge formula through the untwisting limit (ℓ = 1)\n\n⟨B₁|Ψ⟩ = (1 − z₄/(c₁ τ₁(θ₁)))/(1 − z₄/z₁) · ⟨W₋₁^L|Ψ⟩,  1/c₁ = h ∏_{F s} θ₁ₛ ∏_{A s>1} (θ₁ₛ + h).\n\nDeform each HW state with C₁ ≠ 0 to z = 1 + εφ, θ = δθ⁰ (ε = δ), diagonalise the twisted transfer matrices (t₁ and t₃) on the full weight sector and pick the eigenstate with largest overlap with the **t₃-resolved** HW state. Columns: overlap |⟨Ψ_ε|Ψ⟩| (→ 1 if the matching is right), relative residual of the formula, LHS, |⟨W|Ψ⟩|, |bracket|.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "phi = {0.9, 0.4, -0.3, -1.1}; thdir = Take[{2/7, -3/5, 8/11, -11/8, 41/100, -77/100}, LL];\nc1[th_] := 1/(hh Product[If[types[[s]] == \"F\", th[[1]] - th[[s]], th[[1]] - th[[s]] + hh], {s, 2, LL}]);\nuntwistRow[st_, eps_] := Module[{z = 1 + eps phi, th = eps thdir, Lam, idx = sectors[st[\"w\"]], M, V, P, k, psi, tau, lhs, W, fac, ov},\n   Lam = DiagonalMatrix[z];\n   M = Transpose[Table[mixT[th, Lam, N[UnitVector[nn^LL, i]]][[idx]], {i, idx}]];\n   V = Eigenvectors[M];\n   P = (Normal[SparseArray[Thread[idx -> #], nn^LL]]/Norm[#]) & /@ V;\n   ov = Abs[Conjugate[P] . st[\"psi\"]]; k = Ordering[ov, -1][[1]];\n   psi = P[[k]]; psi = psi Abs[Conjugate[psi] . st[\"psi\"]]/(Conjugate[psi] . st[\"psi\"]);\n   tau = (Conjugate[psi] . t1V[th, Lam, th[[1]], psi])/(Conjugate[psi] . psi);\n   lhs = braVec[1] . psi; W = braVec[0] . psi; fac = (1 - z[[4]]/(c1[th] tau))/(1 - z[[4]]/z[[1]]);\n   {eps, ov[[k]], Abs[lhs - fac W]/Abs[lhs], lhs, Abs[W], Abs[fac]}];\nuntwistRows = Flatten[Table[If[Abs[st[\"C\"][[2]]] < 10^-8, {},\n     Prepend[untwistRow[st, #] & /@ {10^-2, 10^-3, 10^-4}, {dyn[st[\"w\"]], \"C₁(HW) = \" <> ToString[NumberForm[st[\"C\"][[2]], 6]], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}]], {st, hwStates}], 1];\nGrid[Prepend[Map[If[NumericQ[#] && !IntegerQ[#], NumberForm[Chop[#, 10^-14], 6], #] &, untwistRows, {2}],\n  {\"ε = δ\", \"|⟨Ψ_ε|Ψ⟩|\", \"|LHS−RHS|/|LHS|\", \"LHS = ⟨B₁|Ψ⟩\", \"|⟨W|Ψ⟩|\", \"|bracket|\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
