   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Diagnostic: what does the twisted state tend to?\n\nFor each adjoint state: take the matched twisted eigenstate at ε = 10⁻⁴, split it as Ψ_ε = a Ψ + χ (χ ⊥ Ψ), and test χ: is it an eigenvector of the untwisted t₁, t₃ combination with the same eigenvalue as Ψ (degenerate partner)? Is it HW (J_{i,i+1}χ = 0)? Its shift parity (χ → ±χ)? Also: dimension of the joint t₁, t₃ eigenspace of Ψ in the whole weight sector.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "twistedState[st_, eps_] := Module[{z = 1 + eps phi, th = eps thdir, Lam, idx = sectors[st[\"w\"]], M, V, P, k, psi},\n   Lam = DiagonalMatrix[z];\n   M = Transpose[Table[mixT[th, Lam, N[UnitVector[nn^LL, i]]][[idx]], {i, idx}]];\n   V = Eigenvectors[M]; P = (Normal[SparseArray[Thread[idx -> #], nn^LL]]/Norm[#]) & /@ V;\n   k = Ordering[Abs[Conjugate[P] . st[\"psi\"]], -1][[1]]; psi = P[[k]];\n   psi Abs[Conjugate[psi] . st[\"psi\"]]/(Conjugate[psi] . st[\"psi\"])];\ndiagRow[st_] := Module[{idx = sectors[st[\"w\"]], M, lam, ns, pe, chi, a},\n   M = Transpose[Table[mixT[th0, G1, N[UnitVector[nn^LL, i]]][[idx]], {i, idx}]];\n   lam = (Conjugate[st[\"psi\"]] . mixT[th0, G1, st[\"psi\"]]);\n   ns = NullSpace[M - lam IdentityMatrix[Length[idx]], Tolerance -> 10^-7];\n   pe = twistedState[st, 10^-4]; a = Conjugate[st[\"psi\"]] . pe; chi = pe - a st[\"psi\"];\n   {dyn[st[\"w\"]], Length[idx], Length[ns], Abs[a], Norm[chi],\n    Norm[mixT[th0, G1, chi] - lam chi]/Norm[chi],\n    Max[Table[Norm[Jop[i, i + 1] . chi], {i, nn - 1}]]/Norm[chi],\n    Norm[chi[[perm]] - chi]/Norm[chi], Norm[chi[[perm]] + chi]/Norm[chi]}];\ndiagRows = diagRow /@ Select[hwStates, Abs[#C[[2]]] > 10^-8 && dyn[#w] == {1, 0, 1} &];\nGrid[Prepend[Map[If[NumericQ[#] && !IntegerQ[#], ScientificForm[#, 3], #] &, diagRows, {2}],\n  {\"Dynkin\", \"sector dim\", \"dim joint eigenspace of Ψ\", \"|a|\", \"‖χ‖\", \"χ eigen, same λ (rel res)\", \"max ‖J₊χ‖/‖χ‖\", \"‖Sχ−χ‖\", \"‖Sχ+χ‖\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
