  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Diagnosis.** The first adjoint state Ψ shares its joint t₁, t₃ eigenspace (dim 2 in the weight sector) with a HW [1,0,1] state χ of **odd momentum** (Sχ = −χ, S = translation by one pair): t₁, t₃ do not separate them. The inhomogeneous deformation θ = δθ⁰ breaks S, so the twisted states tend to an S-mixture of Ψ and χ (|a| = 0.9938, ‖χ‖ = 0.11) — the source of the 0.3121. The second adjoint state has no such partner and converges.\n\n### Fix: pair-periodic deformation\n\nTake θ_A = δα, θ_F = δβ on every pair (α = 2/7, β = −3/5), z = 1 + εφ. A global twist and pair-periodic θ keep [t_a, S] = 0, so S is diagonalised together with t₁, t₃ (`mixT` + 0.11 S). c₁ stays finite (θ₁ − θ_F = δ(α−β) ≠ 0).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "thPP[eps_] := eps Flatten[Table[{2/7, -3/5}, Lp]];\nmixTS[ths_, G_, psi_] := mixT[ths, G, psi] + 0.11 psi[[perm]];\nuntwistRowPP[st_, eps_] := Module[{z = 1 + eps phi, th = thPP[eps], Lam, idx = sectors[st[\"w\"]], M, V, P, k, psi, tau, lhs, W, fac, ov},\n   Lam = DiagonalMatrix[z];\n   M = Transpose[Table[mixTS[th, Lam, N[UnitVector[nn^LL, i]]][[idx]], {i, idx}]];\n   V = Eigenvectors[M]; P = (Normal[SparseArray[Thread[idx -> #], nn^LL]]/Norm[#]) & /@ V;\n   ov = Abs[Conjugate[P] . st[\"psi\"]]; k = Ordering[ov, -1][[1]];\n   psi = P[[k]]; psi = psi Abs[Conjugate[psi] . st[\"psi\"]]/(Conjugate[psi] . st[\"psi\"]);\n   tau = (Conjugate[psi] . t1V[th, Lam, th[[1]], psi])/(Conjugate[psi] . psi);\n   lhs = braVec[1] . psi; W = braVec[0] . psi; fac = (1 - z[[4]]/(c1[th] tau))/(1 - z[[4]]/z[[1]]);\n   {eps, ov[[k]], Abs[lhs - fac W]/Abs[lhs], lhs, Abs[W], Abs[fac], Norm[psi[[perm]] - psi]}];\nuntwistRowsPP = Flatten[Table[If[Abs[st[\"C\"][[2]]] < 10^-8, {},\n     Prepend[untwistRowPP[st, #] & /@ {10^-2, 10^-3, 10^-4}, {dyn[st[\"w\"]], \"C₁(HW) = \" <> ToString[NumberForm[st[\"C\"][[2]], 6]], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}]], {st, hwStates}], 1];\nGrid[Prepend[Map[If[NumericQ[#] && !IntegerQ[#] && !RationalQ[#], ScientificForm[Chop[#, 10^-15], 5], #] &, untwistRowsPP, {2}],\n  {\"ε = δ\", \"|⟨Ψ_ε|Ψ⟩|\", \"|LHS−RHS|/|LHS|\", \"LHS = ⟨B₁|Ψ⟩\", \"|⟨W|Ψ⟩|\", \"|bracket|\", \"‖SΨ_ε−Ψ_ε‖\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
