  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result:** ⟨Ψ_ε|Ψ⟩ → 1 and LHS → 1/√8, but the residual of the formula is O(ε) and ‖SΨ_ε − Ψ_ε‖ = O(ε): with a twist, plain S does **not** commute with t_a. Moving Λ through the monodromy leaves a partial rotation, S⁻¹ t S = R t R⁻¹ with R = ρ(Λ) on sites 3..L, so the commuting operator is a twisted shift. Test the four orderings (ρ_A(Λ) = Λ, ρ_F(Λ) = Λ⁻¹ for diagonal Λ):",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "rhoG[ty_, Lam_] := If[ty == \"A\", N[Lam], N[Inverse[Lam]]];\napplyR[psi_, sites_, Lam_] := Fold[applySite[#1, #2, rhoG[types[[#2]], Lam], LL] &, psi, sites];\nshiftCands[Lam_] := {{\"S∘R(sites 3..L)\", applyR[#, Range[3, LL], Lam][[perm]] &}, {\"R(sites 3..L)∘S\", applyR[#[[perm]], Range[3, LL], Lam] &},\n   {\"S∘R(sites 1,2)\", applyR[#, {1, 2}, Lam][[perm]] &}, {\"R(sites 1,2)∘S\", applyR[#[[perm]], {1, 2}, Lam] &}, {\"plain S\", #[[perm]] &}};\nSeedRandom[3]; psiR = RandomComplex[{-1 - I, 1 + I}, nn^LL]; LamT = DiagonalMatrix[1 + 0.1 phi]; thT = thPP[0.1];\nGrid[Prepend[Table[With[{Sh = c[[2]]}, {c[[1]], Norm[t1V[thT, LamT, 0.37, Sh[psiR]] - Sh[t1V[thT, LamT, 0.37, psiR]]]/Norm[psiR],\n     Norm[t3V[thT, LamT, 0.41, Sh[psiR]] - Sh[t3V[thT, LamT, 0.41, psiR]]]/Norm[psiR]}], {c, shiftCands[LamT]}],\n  {\"candidate\", \"‖[t₁, Ŝ]ψ‖\", \"‖[t₃, Ŝ]ψ‖\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
