  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result:** Ŝ = S∘ρ_{3..L}(Λ) (rotate sites 3..L, then translate) commutes with t₁, t₃ at twist + pair-periodic θ (10⁻¹⁷); the other orderings and plain S do not.\n\n### Does t₂ separate Ψ and χ?\n\nt₂ from 2×2 quantum minors (matrix form, L = 2 pairs only; no vector form for ∧² yet), untwisted homogeneous. Restrict t₁, t₂, t₃ and S to the 2-dim joint t₁, t₃ eigenspace {Ψ, χ} of the first adjoint state.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "siteOpN[s_, m_] := KroneckerProduct @@ Table[If[b == s, N[m], N[id4]], {b, LL}];\nmonoN[ths_, v_] := Module[{T},\n   T = Table[siteOpN[1, origE[types[[1]]][v, ths[[1]]][i, j]], {i, nn}, {j, nn}];\n   Do[T = Table[Sum[T[[i, k]] . siteOpN[s, origE[types[[s]]][v, ths[[s]]][k, j]], {k, nn}], {i, nn}, {j, nn}], {s, 2, LL}]; T];\nt2Mat[ths_, v_] := Module[{T0 = monoN[ths, v], T1 = monoN[ths, v - hh]},\n   Sum[T0[[Ir[[1]], Ir[[1]]]] . T1[[Ir[[2]], Ir[[2]]]] - T0[[Ir[[2]], Ir[[1]]]] . T1[[Ir[[1]], Ir[[2]]]], {Ir, Subsets[Range[nn], {2}]}]];\nt2a = t2Mat[th0, 0.37]; t2b = t2Mat[th0, -0.61];\nchkT2 = Module[{st = First[Select[hwStates, dyn[#w] == {1, 0, 1} && Abs[#C[[2]]] > 0.3 &]], idx, M, lam, ns, D, restr},\n   idx = sectors[st[\"w\"]];\n   M = Transpose[Table[mixT[th0, G1, N[UnitVector[nn^LL, i]]][[idx]], {i, idx}]];\n   lam = Conjugate[st[\"psi\"]] . mixT[th0, G1, st[\"psi\"]];\n   ns = NullSpace[M - lam IdentityMatrix[Length[idx]], Tolerance -> 10^-7];\n   D = Orthogonalize[Normal[SparseArray[Thread[idx -> #], nn^LL]] & /@ ns];\n   restr[op_] := Conjugate[D] . Transpose[op /@ D];\n   {{\"dim {Ψ, χ}\", Length[D]},\n    {\"eigenvalues of t₁(0.37) on it\", Chop[Eigenvalues[restr[t1V[th0, G1, 0.37, #] &]], 10^-10]},\n    {\"eigenvalues of t₃(0.41) on it\", Chop[Eigenvalues[restr[t3V[th0, G1, 0.41, #] &]], 10^-10]},\n    {\"eigenvalues of t₂(0.37) on it\", Chop[Eigenvalues[restr[t2a . # &]], 10^-10]},\n    {\"eigenvalues of t₂(−0.61) on it\", Chop[Eigenvalues[restr[t2b . # &]], 10^-10]},\n    {\"eigenvalues of S on it\", Chop[Eigenvalues[restr[#[[perm]] &]], 10^-10]},\n    {\"[t₂, t₁] = 0 (rel)\", Norm[t2a . t1V[th0, G1, 0.37, st[\"psi\"]] - t1V[th0, G1, 0.37, t2a . st[\"psi\"]]]}}];\nGrid[chkT2, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"15\" data-out-n=\"180\" data-sub-idx=\"5\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"13\" data-sub-start=\"21\" data-sub-end=\"21\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[180]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.44em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim {Ψ, </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">χ</span><span class=\"mord\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eigenvalues of t₁(0.37) on it</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eigenvalues of t₃(0.41) on it</s