  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* one-pass vector t2 (setup cell) against the quantum-minor matrix t2Mat, and on the degenerate pair *)\nSeedRandom[11]; psiT2 = RandomComplex[{-1 - I, 1 + I}, nn^LL];\nt2vRows = {{\"vector t₂(0.37) vs t2Mat, untwisted homogeneous, random ψ\", ScientificForm[Norm[t2a . psiT2 - t2V[th0, G1, 0.37, psiT2]]/Norm[psiT2], 2]},\n   {\"vector t₂(−0.61) vs t2Mat\", ScientificForm[Norm[t2b . psiT2 - t2V[th0, G1, -0.61, psiT2]]/Norm[psiT2], 2]},\n   {\"[t₂, Ŝ] at twist + pair-periodic θ (vector)\", ScientificForm[Norm[t2V[thT, LamT, 0.37, applyR[psiR, Range[3, LL], LamT][[perm]]] - applyR[t2V[thT, LamT, 0.37, psiR], Range[3, LL], LamT][[perm]]]/Norm[psiR], 2]}};\nGrid[t2vRows, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
