"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.7068em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.6034em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.1034em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8068em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.1034em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.0068em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.1034em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.2068em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.1034em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6034em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
