   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result:** U = t₁(θ_F) t̄₃(θ_A−h) = c·S to 10⁻¹⁶ for θ_A−θ_F = 2h, 0.3, −2h, with c = h⁴[x(−x−4h)]² (x = θ_F−θ_A) as predicted; U = 0 at θ_A = θ_F and at θ_A−θ_F = 4h. (At L = 2 pairs S = S⁻¹.) So **S is in the algebra of the t's except at the singular points θ_A−θ_F ∈ {0, 4h}** — and θ_A = θ_F is exactly the point used for the on-shell states. The extra label is an artefact of that point.\n\n### Which relative shift is the ABJM chain?\n\nMinahan–Zarembo two-loop Hamiltonian H = Σ_l (2 − 2P_{l,l+2} + P_{l,l+2}K_{l,l+1} + K_{l,l+1}P_{l,l+2}) (periodic; K = Σ e_ij ⊗ e_ij on A–F neighbours, P on next-to-nearest). Test [H, t₁(u)] and [H, t̄₃(u)] for pair-periodic θ with θ_A−θ_F ∈ {0, 2h, −2h, 0.3}; and at each point the minimal t₁, t̄₃ spectral gap on the HW subspace (no cyclicity imposed) of the [1,0,1] sector.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Pop[a_, b_] := Sum[siteOp[a, ee[i, j]] . siteOp[b, ee[j, i]], {i, nn}, {j, nn}];\nKop[a_, b_] := Sum[siteOp[a, ee[i, j]] . siteOp[b, ee[i, j]], {i, nn}, {j, nn}];\nmodS[l_] := Mod[l - 1, LL] + 1;\nHMZ = N[Sum[2 IdentityMatrix[nn^LL, SparseArray] - 2 Pop[l, modS[l + 2]] + Pop[l, modS[l + 2]] . Kop[l, modS[l + 1]] + Kop[l, modS[l + 1]] . Pop[l, modS[l + 2]], {l, LL}]];\nwAdj = {1, 0, 0, -1};\nhwSub = Module[{idx = sectors[wAdj], A, ns},\n   A = Join @@ Table[Jop[i, i + 1][[All, idx]], {i, nn - 1}]; A = A[[Union[A[\"NonzeroPositions\"][[All, 1]]]]];\n   ns = NullSpace[A]; Normal[SparseArray[Thread[idx -> #], nn^LL]] & /@ Orthogonalize[N[ns]]];\nabjmRow[d_] := Module[{ths = Flatten[Table[{d, 0}, Lp]], c1H, c3H, M, ev},\n   c1H = Norm[HMZ . t1V[ths, G1, 0.37, psiR] - t1V[ths, G1, 0.37, HMZ . psiR]]/Norm[psiR];\n   c3H = Norm[HMZ . t3barV[ths, G1, 0.41, psiR] - t3barV[ths, G1, 0.41, HMZ . psiR]]/Norm[psiR];\n   M = Conjugate[hwSub] . Transpose[(t1V[ths, G1, 0.3711, #] + 0.37 t1V[ths, G1, -0.917, #] + 0.29 t3barV[ths, G1, 0.41, #]) & /@ hwSub];\n   ev = Eigenvalues[M];\n   {d, c1H, c3H, Length[hwSub], Min[Flatten[Table[If[i < j, Abs[ev[[i]] - ev[[j]]], Infinity], {i, Length[ev]}, {j, Length[ev]}]]]}];\nabjmRows = abjmRow /@ {0, 2 hh, -2 hh, 0.3};\nGrid[Prepend[Map[If[NumericQ[#] && !ExactNumberQ[#], ScientificForm[#, 3], #] &, abjmRows, {2}],\n  {\"θ_A − θ_F\", \"‖[H_MZ, t₁]ψ‖\", \"‖[H_MZ, t̄₃]ψ‖\", \"dim HW [1,0,1] sector\", \"min gap of t₁, t̄₃ on it\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"28\" data-out-n=\"343\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"18\" data-sub-start=\"15\" data-sub-end=\"16\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[343]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">_A − </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">_F</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span>