      {
       "data": "Out[343]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{$\\theta$\\_A − $\\theta$\\_F} & \\text{‖[H\\_MZ, t₁]$\\psi$‖} & \\text{‖[H\\_MZ, t̄₃]$\\psi$‖} & \\text{dim HW [1,0,1] sector} & \\text{min gap of t₁, t̄₃ on it}\\\\\\hline0 & \\text{8.64}\\times 10^{\\text{-1}} & \\text{8.64}\\times 10^{\\text{-1}} & 4 & \\text{6.29}\\times 10^{\\text{-10}}\\\\\\hline1 & \\text{3.41}\\times 10^{\\text{-16}} & \\text{5.32}\\times 10^{\\text{-16}} & 4 & \\text{2.74}\\times 10^{\\text{-1}}\\\\\\hline-1 & \\text{1.73} & \\text{1.73} & 4 & \\text{2.23}\\times 10^{\\text{-1}}\\\\\\hline\\text{3.}\\times 10^{\\text{-1}} & \\text{6.05}\\times 10^{\\text{-1}} & \\text{6.05}\\times 10^{\\text{-1}} & 4 & \\text{2.09}\\times 10^{\\text{-2}}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "de68323f-dc6f-49f0-918a-b85cbddbb238"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result:** [H_MZ, t₁] = [H_MZ, t̄₃] = 0 (10⁻¹⁵) **only at θ_A − θ_F = 2h** (both S-dressings = −2h + hK, MZ's −2 + K); at θ_A = θ_F, − 2h and 0.3 the commutators are O(1). At θ_A − θ_F = 2h the t's alone split the HW [1,0,1] sector (gap 0.27). At θ_A = θ_F they don't (gap 0).\n\n⇒ **The ABJM homogeneous point in these conventions is θ_A − θ_F = 2h, not θ = 0.** The on-shell states of §1 and §5.7 (θ = 0) are eigenstates of a different (non-local, singular) member of the family. Redo at the ABJM point.\n\n## 3. On-shell states and bridges at the ABJM point θ_A = 2h, θ_F = 0\n\nSame as §1 (HW ∩ cyclic, joint t₁, t̄₃), plus the H_MZ eigenvalue as a check. Untwisting test with the original generic deformation θ = θ_ABJM + δθ⁰ and no shift operator.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "thABJM = N[Flatten[Table[{2 hh, 0}, Lp]]];\nmixTbar[ths_, G_, psi_] := t1V[ths, G, 0.3711, psi] + 0.37 t1V[ths, G, -0.917, psi] + 0.29 t3barV[ths, G, 0.41, psi] - 0.13 t3barV[ths, G, -0.77, psi];\nhwA = Flatten[Table[Module[{idx = sectors[w], A, ns, H, M, ev, V},\n     A = Join @@ Append[Table[Jop[i, i + 1][[All, idx]], {i, nn - 1}], (shiftM - IdentityMatrix[nn^LL, SparseArray])[[All, idx]]];\n     A = A[[Union[A[\"NonzeroPositions\"][[All, 1]]]]];\n     ns = If[Length[A] == 0, IdentityMatrix[Length[idx]], NullSpace[A]];\n     If[ns === {}, {},\n      H = Normal[SparseArray[Thread[idx -> #], nn^LL]] & /@ Orthogonalize[N[ns]];\n      M = Conjugate[H] . Transpose[mixTbar[thABJM, G1, #] & /@ H];\n      {ev, V} = Eigensystem[M];\n      Table[With[{psi = fixPhase[V[[k]] . H]}, With[{E = Conjugate[psi] . (HMZ . psi)},\n         <|\"w\" -> w, \"psi\" -> psi, \"E\" -> Chop[E], \"Hres\" -> Norm[HMZ . psi - E psi],\n          \"gap\" -> If[Length[ev] > 1, Min[Abs[ev[[k]] - Delete[ev, k]]], Infinity],\n          \"C\" -> Chop[Table[braVec[l] . psi, {l, 0, LL}], 10^-10]|>]], {k, Length[ev]}]]], {w, dominant}], 1];\nGrid[Prepend[{dyn[#w], #E, ScientificForm[#Hres, 2], ScientificForm[#gap, 2], Sequence @@ (NumberForm[#, 6] & /@ #C)} & /@ hwA,\n  Join[{\"Dynkin\", \"E_MZ\", \"‖HΨ − EΨ‖\", \"gap (t₁, t̄₃)\"}, Table[\"C\" <> ToString[l], {l, 0, LL}]]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
