   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Summary — ABJM point (2026-10-12, supersedes the θ = 0 results above)\n\n- **ABJM homogeneous point = θ_A − θ_F = 2h** (here θ_A = 2h, θ_F = 0): the only one of {0, ±2h, 0.3} where the Minahan–Zarembo Hamiltonian commutes with t₁, t̄₃ (10⁻¹⁵). There t₁(θ_F) t̄₃(θ_A−h) = h⁴ · S (pair shift), so S is in the algebra.\n- **θ_A = θ_F (used in §1 and in `checks/abjm_bridges.py`, §5.7) is singular:** t₁(θ_F) t̄₃(θ_A−h) = 0, S drops out of the t-algebra, hence the extra \"momentum\" label and the t₁, t₂, t₃-degenerate pair — and the states there are not H_MZ eigenstates. The §5.7 table and the twisted-shift fix are artefacts of that point.\n- **L = 2 pairs at the ABJM point:** the t's alone resolve all HW cyclic states (all H_MZ eigenstates to 10⁻¹⁴):\n\n| state | E_MZ | nonzero C_ℓ |\n|---|---|---|\n| [2,0,2] vacuum | 0 | all 1 |\n| [0,2,0] | 16 | — |\n| [1,0,1] parity pair | 12, 12 | C₁ = C₃ = (1 ∓ i√3)/√48, \\|C₁\\| = 1/√12 |\n| singlet | 20 | C₂ = −1/√40 |\n| singlet | 4 | C₂ = 1/√24 |\n\n  (Adjoints and singlets: odd/even selection rule unchanged. The adjoints are degenerate in H_MZ, split by the higher charges; their C's are complex, phase fixed by the largest component.)\n- **Odd-bridge formula** through the untwisting limit at the ABJM point, generic inhomogeneous deformation, no shift operator: overlap → 1, |LHS| → 1/√12, exact to 10⁻¹¹–10⁻¹⁴ at every ε; ⟨W|Ψ⟩ ~ ε, bracket ~ 1/ε.\n- Closed forms are numerical recognitions.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result:** on {Ψ, χ} the restrictions of t₁, t₂ (two u values) and t₃ are all multiples of the identity; only S separates them (eigenvalues +1, −1). So the whole commuting family t₁, t₂, t₃ is degenerate there and momentum is a genuinely extra label.\n\n### Untwisting test with the twisted shift Ŝ\n\nPair-periodic θ, diagonalise `mixT` + 0.11 Ŝ (Ŝ commutes exactly), match to the HW cyclic state.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "mixTShat[ths_, G_, psi_] := mixT[ths, G, psi] + 0.11 applyR[psi, Range[3, LL], G][[perm]];\nuntwistRowHat[st_, eps_] := Module[{z = 1 + eps phi, th = thPP[eps], Lam, idx = sectors[st[\"w\"]], M, V, P, k, psi, tau, lhs, W, fac, ov},\n   Lam = DiagonalMatrix[z];\n   M = Transpose[Table[mixTShat[th, Lam, N[UnitVector[nn^LL, i]]][[idx]], {i, idx}]];\n   V = Eigenvectors[M]; P = (Normal[SparseArray[Thread[idx -> #], nn^LL]]/Norm[#]) & /@ V;\n   ov = Abs[Conjugate[P] . st[\"psi\"]]; k = Ordering[ov, -1][[1]];\n   psi = P[[k]]; psi = psi Abs[Conjugate[psi] . st[\"psi\"]]/(Conjugate[psi] . st[\"psi\"]);\n   tau = (Conjugate[psi] . t1V[th, Lam, th[[1]], psi])/(Conjugate[psi] . psi);\n   lhs = braVec[1] . psi; W = braVec[0] . psi; fac = (1 - z[[4]]/(c1[th] tau))/(1 - z[[4]]/z[[1]]);\n   {eps, ov[[k]], Abs[lhs - fac W]/Abs[lhs], lhs, Abs[W], Abs[fac], Norm[t1V[th, Lam, 0.37, psi] - tau1x[th, Lam, psi] psi]}];\ntau1x[th_, Lam_, psi_] := (Conjugate[psi] . t1V[th, Lam, 0.37, psi]);\nuntwistRowsHat = Flatten[Table[If[Abs[st[\"C\"][[2]]] < 10^-8, {},\n     Prepend[untwistRowHat[st, #] & /@ {10^-2, 10^-3, 10^-4}, {dyn[st[\"w\"]], \"C₁(HW) = \" <> ToString[NumberForm[st[\"C\"][[2]], 6]], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}]], {st, hwStates}], 1];\nGrid[Prepend[Map[If[NumericQ[#] && !IntegerQ[#] && !RationalQ[#], ScientificForm[Chop[#, 10^-15], 6], #] &, untwistRowsHat, {2}],\n  {\"ε = δ\", \"|⟨Ψ_ε|Ψ⟩|\", \"|LHS−RHS|/|LHS|\", \"LHS = ⟨B₁|Ψ⟩\", \"|⟨W|Ψ⟩|\", \"|bracket|\", \"eigenvector residual of t₁\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
